    "summary": {
      "value": "Gain benefits for consecutive attacks with brawling weapons."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Fury</strong> or <strong>Weaponmaster</strong>.</p><hr><p>When you perform a <strong>melee</strong> attack using a <strong>brawling weapon</strong>, if you have <strong>no martial armor</strong> and <strong>no shields</strong> equipped, you gain <strong>1 Bravery Point</strong>.</p><p>As long as you have <strong>no martial armor</strong> and <strong>no shields</strong> equipped, your <strong>melee</strong> attacks with <strong>brawling weapons</strong> deal extra damage equal to <strong>【2 + your current Bravery Points】</strong>.</p><p>At the end of each scene, <strong>or</strong> if you have <strong>5 or more Bravery Points</strong> at the end of your turn, you lose all accumulated Bravery Points. Then, if you lost at least 1 point this way, you recover 10 Hit Points <strong>and</strong> 10 Mind Points.</p><hr><p><strong>Resource:</strong> @PROGRESS[rising-tide update 1]{Gain 1 Bravery Point} or @PROGRESS[rising-tide reset]{Lose All Bravery Points}<br><strong>You Recover:</strong> @GAIN[10 hp] @GAIN[10 mp]</p>",
